  "checks": {
    "identity-and-scale": "Eight native poses retain short swept grey hair, bronze spectacles, red scarf, two short brass-bound beard tips, patterned dark waistcoat, stocky seated body, capped boots and the same chair. Whole authored poses use a common seated extent, lower body/chair horizontal centers and visible boot-floor roots, with the existing effective seated registration650. No precise sole-material, hidden heel or walking calibration claim.",
    "station-and-foot-contact": "Independent ledger desk retains original static books/open ledger/inkwell/brass counter. Same650/[320,616] basis as original writing actor; original chair remains actor-owned. All eight native layered compositions and live poses inspected. Legs stay behind desk; visible seated boot-floor placement remains stable at the fixed task root. Desk persists after departure. No moving planted-foot certification.",
    "hand-and-tool-contact": "Same plain disk is pinched by right thumb/index throughout readiness, lift, high inspection, wrist turn, lowering and settled completion. Low poses0/6/7 from two broad sheets were rejected for pointed pen remnants; three targeted full-pose edits from clean pose5 replace them. Selected source pixels have no coin shaft or quill. Skin/coin foreground contours cover both hands and visible forearms without copying the dark vest wedge over the ledger.",
    "prop-continuity": "Coin remains in the same hand throughout0-7. Final pose adjusts and settles the low held disk; no deposit, new stack coin, disappearance, handoff or minting is implied. Static desk counter belongs to the desk. This is inspection of an already-counted coin rather than a represented accounting transaction.",
    "completion-and-reset": "Actual renderer exposes all eight authored durations on alternate consultant days, completes once, holds final7 for5000ms, releases on departure, resets0 on explicit return and selects writing again on day3. Production assignment is rejected; finished cosmetic activity remains available after day resolution. Tests retain Borrin outside worker payroll/capability and economic output."
